wg-stranger-verb-talk = Talk
wg-stranger-hail-title = { $name } wants a word
wg-stranger-hail-talk = Talk
wg-stranger-hail-ignore = Ignore
wg-stranger-dialogue-close = Leave
wg-stranger-option-cost = { $text } ({ $cost } spesos)

wg-stranger-dealer-hail = Psst. Hey. You. Over here.
wg-stranger-dealer-pitch = You look like you've had a long day. I can make it shorter. Or longer. Whatever you need.
wg-stranger-dealer-ask = What've you got?
wg-stranger-dealer-no = Not interested.
wg-stranger-dealer-menu = Space dust, rainbow joints, the good stuff. Harder stuff if you've got the money. No questions.
wg-stranger-dealer-buy = Something to take the edge off.
wg-stranger-dealer-buy-hard = Something harder.
wg-stranger-dealer-buy-stick = Got anything for a synth?
wg-stranger-dealer-sticks = Copies of copies, one load each. They bite a little. Which one?
wg-stranger-dealer-stick-whiteline = Whiteline. Something fast.
wg-stranger-dealer-stick-null-loop = Null Loop. Something quiet.
wg-stranger-dealer-stick-burst = Burst. Something that lasts.
wg-stranger-dealer-stick-idle = Idle. Something easy.
wg-stranger-dealer-buy-seeds = Seeds. I'll grow my own.
wg-stranger-dealer-buy-tester = A tester, so I know what I'm getting.
wg-stranger-dealer-pass = Too rich for me.
wg-stranger-dealer-sold = Pleasure. You never saw me.
wg-stranger-dealer-broke = You're broke? Don't waste my time. Beat it.
wg-stranger-dealer-snubbed = Oh, you're too good for me, huh? HUH?!
wg-stranger-dealer-threaten = Get lost before I call security.
wg-stranger-dealer-shrug = Your loss. You know where to find me.

wg-stranger-mugger-hail = Hey! Hold up a second, friend.
wg-stranger-mugger-demand = Nice boots. Real nice. Hand over a hundred and fifty and you get to keep walking in them.
wg-stranger-mugger-pay = Fine. Take it.
wg-stranger-mugger-refuse = No.
wg-stranger-mugger-bluff = My friends are right behind me.
wg-stranger-mugger-paid = Smart. Off you go.
wg-stranger-mugger-bluffed = Sure they are. Last chance.
wg-stranger-mugger-refused = Wrong answer.
wg-stranger-mugger-waved = Yeah, keep walking. Next time.

wg-stranger-preacher-hail = Brother! Sister! Hear me!
wg-stranger-preacher-sermon = The stars are going out one by one! The end is near, and it is coming for this rock first!
wg-stranger-preacher-more = Go on, tell me more.
wg-stranger-preacher-mock = You're out of your mind.
wg-stranger-preacher-prophecy = The old ones sleep under the stone. When the last ship leaves, they wake. Will you help spread the word?
wg-stranger-preacher-donate = Here's something for the cause.
wg-stranger-preacher-leave = I'll pass.
wg-stranger-preacher-blessed = Bless you! Take this, and read it before the sky falls.
wg-stranger-preacher-pity = Your pockets are as empty as your soul. Go in peace, lost one.
wg-stranger-preacher-cursed = The end comes for you too! Remember I warned you!
wg-stranger-preacher-threaten = Shut up or I'll shut you up.
wg-stranger-preacher-wrath = Heretic! I'll send you to the old ones myself!

wg-stranger-conspiracist-hail = You. You're not one of them. I can tell.
wg-stranger-conspiracist-warning = They're watching us. The satellites, the radios. Through the WALLS.
wg-stranger-conspiracist-who = Who's watching?
wg-stranger-conspiracist-help = You need help.
wg-stranger-conspiracist-theory = The Reavers, the ADS, the Union. All one company. Same paycheque. And they put chips in the ration bars.
wg-stranger-conspiracist-believe = I believe you.
wg-stranger-conspiracist-doubt = That's ridiculous.
wg-stranger-conspiracist-gift = Finally, someone awake! Here. Wear this. It blocks the signal.
wg-stranger-conspiracist-offended = That's exactly what they'd want you to say. Exactly.
wg-stranger-conspiracist-insult = Take that tinfoil off, you lunatic.
wg-stranger-conspiracist-accuse = Maybe I'm one of them.
wg-stranger-conspiracist-snapped = I KNEW IT! You're one of THEM!

wg-stranger-beggar-hail = Spare a moment, friend?
wg-stranger-beggar-plea = Spare some credits for a meal? Anything helps. I'll give you something I found out there.
wg-stranger-beggar-give = Here's twenty.
wg-stranger-beggar-refuse = Sorry, I can't.
wg-stranger-beggar-thanks = Bless you, friend. Here, take this. Found it in the dirt.
wg-stranger-beggar-sorry = No money either, huh? Hard times all round.
wg-stranger-beggar-sad = Yeah. Nobody can, these days.
wg-stranger-beggar-mock = Get a job.
wg-stranger-beggar-spite = Think you're better than me? Let's see about that!

wg-stranger-stalker-caught = ...I'm not following you.
wg-stranger-stalker-who = Who are you?
wg-stranger-stalker-leave = Leave me alone.
wg-stranger-stalker-nobody = Nobody. Just walking. Same way as you.
wg-stranger-stalker-okay = Okay.
wg-stranger-stalker-threaten = Follow me again and I'll kill you.
wg-stranger-stalker-unmasked = ...not if I get you first.
wg-stranger-stalker-mutter-1 = ...nice ship...
wg-stranger-stalker-mutter-2 = ...same way as you...
wg-stranger-stalker-mutter-3 = ...don't mind me...
wg-stranger-stalker-mutter-4 = ...I like your boots...
wg-stranger-stalker-mutter-5 = ...we're friends now...

wg-stranger-squatter-mine = MINE! It's MINE! Get OUT!

wg-stranger-greeting-house-1 = Hey there! Come on over, stranger.
wg-stranger-greeting-house-2 = Visitors! Haven't seen one in a while.
wg-stranger-greeting-house-3 = Don't be shy. Come say hello.
wg-stranger-greeting-house-4 = You there! You lost, or just passing?
wg-stranger-greeting-camp-1 = Welcome to our camp, stranger.
wg-stranger-greeting-camp-2 = What brings you to our fire?
wg-stranger-greeting-camp-3 = You look like you could use some company.
wg-stranger-greeting-camp-4 = Hey! Over here. Don't mind the smell.
